  "description": "The DK Professional celebrates 10 years of topping podiums and high performance with an all-new design called Professional-X. Building on the same proven geometry that’s been raced to countless UCI World titles and Olympic main events, the Professional-X is remastered to be stiffer, faster, and deliver straight out of the gate.\n\nThe Professional-X frame includes a Hydroformed tube set with tear drop and hourglass bridges, 3D dropouts with 20/15/10mm axle compatibility. The low-profile geometry of each frame size is crafted for speed and stability.\n\nDetails\n\nWorld Championship Team DK design\n\nBuilt with lightweight 6000 series Hydroformed aluminum tubing\n\nTapered 1-1/8”—1.5” head tube (headset included with an extra lower race to work with standard 1-1/8” non-tapered forks)\n\nInternal brake cable routing\n\nTrapezoidal seat mast for increased stiffness at bottom bracket\n\n20mm / 15mm / 10mm dropouts (all axle hardware included) with integrated chain tensioners\n\nThreaded Euro bottom bracket shell (BB not included)\n\nSeat post diameter: 27.2mm\n\nPro XL\n\nTop Tube Length 20.5” 21”\n\nChain Stay Length 14.83” 14.83”\n\nHead Tube Angle 74º 74º\n\nSeat Tube Angle 72º 72º\n\nBB Drop -35mm -35mm\n\nSeat Tube Length 7.4” 7.4”\n\nHeadset Type Tapered 1.5” Tapered 1.5”\n\nRear Axle Size 10mm, 15mm, or 20mm 10mm, 15mm, or 20mm\n\nWeight 3.95 lbs 3.97 lbs\n\nXXL XXX\n\nTop Tube Length 21.5” 22”\n\nChain Stay Length 15” 15”\n\nHead Tube Angle 74º 74º\n\nSeat Tube Angle 72º 72º\n\nBB Drop -35mm -35mm\n\nSeat Tube Length 7.4” 7.4”\n\nHeadset Type Tapered 1.5” Tapered 1.5”\n\nRear Axle Size 10mm, 15mm, or 20mm 10mm, 15mm, or 20mm\n\nWeight 4.06 lbs 4.08 lbs\n\nCruiser\n\nTop Tube Length 21.75”\n\nChain Stay Length 15.25”\n\nHead Tube Angle 73º\n\nSeat Tube Angle 72º\n\nBB Drop -5mm\n\nSeat Tube Length 8”\n\nHeadset Type Tapered 1.5”\n\nRear Axle Size 10mm”, 15mm, or 20mm\n\nWeight 4.06 lbs\n\nBMX RACE BIKE SIZE GUIDE",
